Examples</a></li><li class="leftmenu"><a href="/structural-design-patterns-in-c-sharp">Structural Design Patterns in C#</a></li><li class="leftmenu"><a href="/c-sharp-program-for-producing-a-filtered-sequence-of-elements-that-contain-only-one-property-of-given-data">C# Program for Producing a Filtered Sequence of Elements that Contain Only One Property of Given Data</a></li><li class="leftmenu"><a href="/timespan-subtract-method-in-c-sharp">TimeSpan.Subtract() Method in C#</a></li><li class="leftmenu"><a href="/immutable-in-c-sharp">Immutable in C#</a></li></ul></div></div></div><div class="accordion-item" style="background-color:var(--sidebar)"><h2 class="accordion-header" id="flush-heading32"><button aria-controls="flush-collapse32" aria-expanded="true" class="accordion-button sidebar-btn" data-bs-target="#flush-collapse32" data-bs-toggle="collapse" type="button">ASP.NET Tutorial</button></h2><div aria-labelledby="flush-heading32" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" id="flush-collapse32"><div class="accordion-body"><ul><li class="leftmenu"><a href="/asp-net-tutorial">ASP.NET Tutorial (50+)</a></li></ul></div></div></div><div class="accordion-item" style="background-color:var(--sidebar)"><h2 class="accordion-header" id="flush-heading33"><button aria-controls="flush-collapse33" aria-expanded="true" class="accordion-button sidebar-btn" data-bs-target="#flush-collapse33" data-bs-toggle="collapse" type="button">ADO.NET Tutorial</button></h2><div aria-labelledby="flush-heading33" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" id="flush-collapse33"><div class="accordion-body"><ul><li class="leftmenu"><a href="/ado-net-tutorial">ADO.NET Tutorial (10+)</a></li></ul></div></div></div><div class="accordion-item" style="background-color:var(--sidebar)"><h2 class="accordion-header" id="flush-heading34"><button aria-controls="flush-collapse34" aria-expanded="true" class="accordion-button sidebar-btn" data-bs-target="#flush-collapse34" data-bs-toggle="collapse" type="button">C# W